  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your bound spirit lashes out in anger against any who disturb its vessel.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Iron Will, Jealous Guardian†, Unyielding Personality†.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> While you are bound to a spirit, whenever you succeed on a Will saving throw against a mind-affecting effect, you may expend a bound spirit’s major granted ability for 5 rounds as an immediate action in order to deal 1d6 points of damage per level of the spirit to the creature who targeted you with the mind-affecting effect. This damage is untyped.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/pact-magic-feats#toc69\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
